                "title": "4 x 4 x Square Corners Heavy Duty Non-Removable Pin Ball Bearing Hinges, Pair, Deltana S44HDBBNRP",
                "description": "Deltana S44HDBBNRP  4 x 4 Heavy Duty hinge with 2 Ball Bearings and Non-Removable pin. Heavy duty 0.129 thick,  Available in 9 different finishes. Package includes a pair of hinges (2) with matching finish steel flathead, Phillips Drive #12 x 1 wood screws and #12-24 x 1/2 machine screws.",
